{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Act as an expert Shopify frontend and Liquid developer. Build a fully responsive, pixel-perfect custom multi-card feature grid section based entirely on the visual layout, spacing, and copy structure shown in the reference image "image_5c8022.jpg".
    
    ### 1. Global Integration, Max Width & Basic Styles
    - **Theme Identity:** The section wrapper must automatically inherit the current theme's typography variables (e.g., `var(--font-heading-family)` and `var(--font-body-family)`), standard section maximum layout width (e.g., matching `.page-width` or `.container` wrappers), and default responsive side padding.
    - **Section Background:** Pure white background (#FFFFFF) with comfortable top and bottom padding.
    - **Grid Layout:** - Top Area: Centered or left-aligned text headers.
      - Middle Area: A 2-column horizontal card grid on desktop.
      - Bottom Area: A full-width horizontal highlight card sitting below the 2-column grid.
      - Mobile Fallback: On mobile viewports, all cards must smoothly transition into a single vertical stacked column with uniform gaps (~16px to 20px).
    
    ### 2. Section Header Group
    Positioned cleanly at the top left/center:
    - **Top Micro-Badge:** "HOW FLOW IS DIFFERENT"
      - Styling: All caps, rendered inside a small rectangular badge featuring a very light gray background wash and subtle letter-spacing.
    - **Main Section Heading:** "REAL-TIME CONVERSION\nINTELLIGENCE."
      - Styling: Large, exceptionally bold, deep navy blue text (#0E2A3A).
    - **Introduction Subheading:** "Flow combines accurate traffic measurement with POS integration and behavioral analytics to give you complete conversion visibility and actionable operational guidance."
      - Styling: Muted slate-gray text with generous line-height for elite scannability.
    
    ### 3. Card Grid Block Component Specifications
    Build a dynamic loop (`{% for block in section.blocks %}`) supporting different block themes so each item can be customized in the theme editor:
    
    #### CARD 1 (Left): Accurate Traffic Measurement (Dark Theme Card)
    - **Background Styling:** Solid deep navy blue background wash (#0E2A3A).
    - **Card Shape:** Smooth rounded corners (border-radius: 16px).
    - **Card Icon Accent:** A small, soft lime-green square badge with rounded corners holding an inline line-art SVG bar chart icon.
    - **Card Title Text:** "Accurate Traffic Measurement" (Bold, crisp white text color).
    - **Card Body Text:** "AI-powered cameras measure every customer entry with 98%+ accuracy. Staff movements are automatically excluded. You know exactly how many customers entered your store at any given time."
      - Styling: High-contrast, clean white text color with soft formatting.
    - **Bullet List Items:** A vertical list of 3 rows. Each row features a small custom green circle checkbox mark outline inline SVG, followed by crisp white inline text strings exactly as follows:
      1. Real-time entry counting
      2. Staff exclusion active
      3. 15-minute interval updates
    
    #### CARD 2 (Right): Automatic POS Correlation (Light Theme Card)
    - **Background Styling:** Pure white or ultra-faint off-white background wash with an incredibly subtle light gray border wrap.
    - **Card Shape:** Smooth rounded corners (border-radius: 16px).
    - **Card Icon Accent:** A small, ultra-light pastel green tinted square badge holding an inline lime-green lightning bolt outline SVG icon.
    - **Card Title Text:** "Automatic POS Correlation" (Bold, deep navy blue text color).
    - **Card Body Text:** "Flow connects directly to your POS system to correlate traffic with transactions. Conversion rate is calculated automatically throughout the day."
      - Styling: Muted slate-gray text color.
    - **Bullet List Items:** A vertical list of 3 rows. Each row features a small custom green circle checkbox mark outline inline SVG, followed by muted slate-gray text strings exactly as follows:
      1. Direct POS integration
      2. Real-time CVR calculation
      3. Historical trend comparison
    
    #### CARD 3 (Bottom Full-Width Highlight Banner): The Flow Advantage
    - **Layout Integration:** Sits centered directly beneath the dual column blocks, spanning across the entire maximum width container.
    - **Background Styling:** An ultra-soft, gradient tinted horizontal banner wash fading smoothly between light pastel green and off-white. It features a thin, clean light-green border outline.
    - **Card Shape:** Smooth rounded corners (border-radius: 16px).
    - **Layout Structure:** On desktop, use a horizontal flex/grid layout matching:
      - **Left Side Element:** A lime-green rounded circle badge containing a white target/concentric circle bullseye inline SVG icon.
      - **Right Side Content Element:** A vertical text grouping containing:
        - **Banner Header Text:** "The Flow Advantage" (Bold, prominent, deep navy blue text).
        - **Banner Body Text paragraph:** "Unlike basic people counters, Flow provides complete operational context. You don't just see conversion rate—you understand why it's changing, which stores are underperforming, and what operational a
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-flow-feature-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    padding: 60px 0;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-flow-feature-grid__container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: var(--page-width, 1600px);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 var(--spacing-large, 40px);
  }

  .ai-flow-feature-grid__header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .ai-flow-feature-grid__badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 6px 12px;
    background-color: #f3f4f6;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #6b7280;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .ai-flow-feature-grid__title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-heading-family, inherit);
    font-size: 48px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: #0E2A3A;
    margin: 0 0 20px 0;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .ai-flow-feature-grid__subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-body-family, inherit);
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #64748b;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-flow-feature-grid__cards-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .ai-flow-feature-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 40px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .ai-flow-feature-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}--dark {
    background-color: #0E2A3A;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .ai-flow-feature-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}--light {
    background-color: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    color: #0E2A3A;
  }

  .ai-flow-feature-card__icon-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .ai-flow-feature-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}--dark .ai-flow-feature-card__icon-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: #a0b842;
  }

  .ai-flow-feature-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}--light .ai-flow-feature-card__icon-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: #f0fdf4;
  }

  .ai-flow-feature-card__icon-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
  }

  .ai-flow-feature-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}--dark .ai-flow-feature-card__icon-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    stroke: #ffffff;
  }

  .ai-flow-feature-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}--light .ai-flow-feature-card__icon-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    stroke: #a0b842;
  }

  .ai-flow-feature-card__title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-heading-family, inherit);
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
  }

  .ai-flow-feature-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}--dark .ai-flow-feature-card__title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .ai-flow-feature-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}--light .ai-flow-feature-card__title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: #0E2A3A;
  }

  .ai-flow-feature-card__description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-body-family, inherit);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0 0 24px 0;
  }

  .ai-flow-feature-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}--dark .ai-flow-feature-card__description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: #e5e7eb;
  }

  .ai-flow-feature-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}--light .ai-flow-feature-card__description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: #64748b;
  }

  .ai-flow-feature-card__list-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .ai-flow-feature-card__list-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    font-family: var(--font-body-family, inherit);
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  .ai-flow-feature-card__list-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ai-flow-feature-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}--dark .ai-flow-feature-card__list-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    stroke: #a0b842;
    fill: none;
  }

  .ai-flow-feature-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}--light .ai-flow-feature-card__list-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    stroke: #a0b842;
    fill: none;
  }

  .ai-flow-feature-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}--dark .ai-flow-feature-card__list-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .ai-flow-feature-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}--light .ai-flow-feature-card__list-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: #64748b;
  }

  .ai-flow-feature-highlight-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 32px 40px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f0fdf4 0%, #ffffff 100%);
    border: 1px solid #a0b842;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .ai-flow-feature-highlight__icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: #a0b842;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ai-flow-feature-highlight__icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    stroke: #ffffff;
    fill: none;
  }

  .ai-flow-feature-highlight__content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .ai-flow-feature-highlight__title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-heading-family, inherit);
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #0E2A3A;
    margin: 0 0 8px 0;
  }

  .ai-flow-feature-highlight__description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-body-family, inherit);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #64748b;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-flow-feature-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 40px 0;
    }

    .ai-flow-feature-grid__container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 0 var(--spacing-medium, 20px);
    }

    .ai-flow-feature-grid__header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .ai-flow-feature-grid__title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 32px;
    }

    .ai-flow-feature-grid__subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .ai-flow-feature-grid__cards-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .ai-flow-feature-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 28px;
    }

    .ai-flow-feature-card__title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 20px;
    }

    .ai-flow-feature-card__description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .ai-flow-feature-highlight-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      padding: 24px;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .ai-flow-feature-highlight__icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 56px;
      height: 56px;
    }

    .ai-flow-feature-highlight__icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
      width: 28px;
      height: 28px;
    }

    .ai-flow-feature-highlight__title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .ai-flow-feature-highlight__description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 15px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-flow-feature-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
